<title>TURKEY: Turkish official jobless rate falls to 6.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Turkish official jobless rate falls to 6.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's official unemployment rate, measured semi-annually, fell to 6.3 percent in April from 6.6 percent in October 1995 and 7.2 percent in the same 1995 month, the State Institute of Statistics said.</p>
<p>It said 21.38 million of Turkey's 61.4 million population was employed in April.</p>
<p>Unofficial estimates put the figure at around 15 percent.</p>
</text>
